```
src/
  main.ts                # bootstrap — YOURS (written once): ValidationPipe + CORS + listen
  app.module.ts          # root module — YOURS: imports the generated module, add your own here
  generated/             # owned by Backbone — regenerated wholesale, do not edit
    generated.module.ts  # TypeORM DataSource + every feature module
<% for (const e of view.entities) { -%>
    <%= e.varName %>/<%= " ".repeat(Math.max(1, 18 - e.varName.length)) %># <%= e.name %>: entity + dto/ + service + controller + module
<% } -%>
<% if (auth) { -%>
    auth/              # register / login / me + JwtGuard (users table)
<% } -%>
```

Anything under `src/generated/` is overwritten every time you regenerate. `main.ts` and
`app.module.ts` are yours — add custom modules and providers there.

